.TH ALERT\-POLICY 1 "2026-10-29" "unheaded b06c570c" "Unheaded Kingdom"
.SH NAME
alert\-policy \- Render observability/alerting/policy.yaml into Prometheus SLO rules and Alertmanager routing, and check hand\-written rules (ADR\-100).
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B alert\-policy
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Render observability/alerting/policy.yaml into Prometheus SLO rules and Alertmanager routing, and check hand\-written rules (ADR\-100).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-check
fail if the generated files are stale or the policy is invalid
.TP
.B \-\-root \fISTRING\fR
repository root (default .)
.TP
.B \-\-runbooks
only check that every alert's runbook_url names a file in the repo
.TP
.B \-\-sync\-well
write the policy's SLOs into the Well's slo_definitions (needs WELL_DB and WELL_PASSWORD)
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
display this help and exit
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
output version information and exit
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
alert\-policy \-check
alert\-policy \-sync\-well
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR unheaded (1)
